flowchart LR
  subgraph SRC["⓪ Single source of truth · everything else is a projection"]
    direction TB
    R1["GitHub master<br/>source · hook templates · CI · docs"]
    R2["npm tarball dsh-signoff@3.9.7<br/>package.json carries mcpName"]
    R3["server.json + smithery.yaml<br/>raw material for listings"]
    R4["docs/diagrams/src/*.mmd<br/>the diagrams are sources too"]
    R1 ~~~ R2 ~~~ R3 ~~~ R4
  end

  subgraph PUB["① Publish channels · where content is actually downloadable"]
    direction TB
    C1["npm registry<br/>dsh-signoff · latest 3.9.7<br/>the only install path"]
    C2["GitHub Releases<br/>v3.9.7 bilingual notes + tgz"]
    C3["Official MCP Registry<br/>io.github.ayuanxx-max/signoff@3.9.7<br/>mcpName verified"]
    C4["OpenViking docs<br/>viking://resources/dsh/signoff-*"]
    C1 ~~~ C2 ~~~ C3 ~~~ C4
  end

  subgraph IDX["② Indexes and lists · whether anyone can find you"]
    direction TB
    subgraph IDXP["submitted / happens automatically"]
      direction TB
      I1["awesome-mcp-servers · PR #18813<br/>Developer Tools · human review 1–3 days"]
      I2["Glama · auto-indexes the repo and scores it<br/>the listing carries its badge"]
      I1 ~~~ I2
    end
    subgraph IDXR["not submitted yet · material ready"]
      direction TB
      I3["Smithery · smithery.yaml ready<br/>needs GitHub OAuth on the web"]
      I4["mcp.so · PulseMCP<br/>mostly pull the official registry, usually automatic"]
      I5["ClawHub skills market<br/>skill written, not published"]
      I6["other awesome-* lists<br/>git-hooks / pre-commit / ai-agents"]
      I3 ~~~ I4 ~~~ I5 ~~~ I6
    end
  end

  subgraph SEE["③ Discovery · where users actually come from"]
    direction TB
    V1["GitHub search and topics<br/>11 topics set"]
    V2["click from a curated list"]
    V3["word of mouth / posts / comparisons"]
    V4["npm search: dsh-signoff"]
    V1 ~~~ V2 ~~~ V3 ~~~ V4
  end

  N1["Key distinction: registry and lists are indexes, they generate no traffic<br/>traffic comes from curated lists, citations and search hits"]
  N2["Progress: channels 4/4 done<br/>indexes = 1 in review + 1 automatic + 1 submittable + 1 synced + 2 not submitted"]

  SRC -->|publish| PUB
